00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:39,200
Jaime.

152
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,400
Yes, Jaime Mill.

153
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:43,360
Yes, John Stuart Mill, but then there's James Mill.

154
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:43,560
All right.

155
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:48,480
So, you know, a bunch of economists are closely associated with the philosophy of utilitarianism.

