Have you tried?

199
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:09,720
Just try.

200
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:13,680
At the margin, if you could just marginally lower your expectations by 5%,

201
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:18,200
that would do more for your happiness than almost anything else you're trying to do right now.

202
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:22,200
But I told this to my wife, she said, that's cheating.

203
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:27,120
Well, who made up the rules of this game anyway?

