00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:45,320
or whether there's more to it than that.

209
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:51,040
Now, the main reason that economists rarely talk about happiness, although it has increased

210
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:54,280
over time, is that talking about happiness seems

211
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:57,160
to require interpersonal utility comparisons.

212
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,280
Oh my God.

213
00:10:58,280 --> 00:11:02,760
Interpersonal utility comparisons, saying that one person is happier than another person

214
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:06,360
and also figuring out how much happier they are than another person.

215
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:09,440
So a way that some economists put it, how do you add happiness?

